author=kailashrs
description=50 MP on the main, ultrawide and HP9 for third-party apps (exposeFullSizeForQCFA + sensor-mode rules) and hidden-camera access for PhotonCamera and Open Camera. Pair with OriTweaks "Full resolution in camera apps". App mountinfo stays stock: the patched config is bound in a private /vendor subtree visible only to the camera stack.
